蓬莱 · Penglai
================

Penglai (蓬莱) 0.4 is a TypeScript/Tauri application built around the pinned Pi
agent runtime. The repository history before 0.4 includes MIT-licensed
GenericAgent-derived work; that history remains available in the 0.3 tags but
is not the 0.4 runtime.


